msgid "Generate SqDRIFT circuits {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng mga SqDRIFT circuit {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With sample-based quantum diagonalization ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), you must choose an ansatz from which to sample bitstrings. The [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) variant uses an ensemble of time evolution circuits constructed directly from the target Hamiltonian instead. This is achieved by subsampling smaller time evolution operators from the Hamiltonian based on its coefficients, which is known as the [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017) Trotterization method.\n"
msgstr "Sa sample-based quantum diagonalization ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), kailangan mong pumili ng ansatz na pagkukunan ng mga bitstring. Ang variant na [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) ay gumagamit na lang ng ensemble ng mga time evolution circuit na direktang binuo mula sa target na Hamiltonian. Nagagawa ito sa pag-subsample ng mas maliliit na time evolution operator mula sa Hamiltonian batay sa mga coefficient nito, na kilala bilang paraan ng Trotterization na [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This getting started guide shows how to generate an ensemble of such randomized circuits.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng getting started guide na ito kung paano gumawa ng ensemble ng mga ganitong randomized na circuit.\n"

