#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now that you have successfully generated an ensemble of circuits, you can sample bitstrings from them. To do so, the circuits must be executed on hardware. Refer to the [Qiskit documentation](/guides/intro-to-patterns) for detailed instructions.\n"
msgstr "Ngayong matagumpay ka nang nakagawa ng ensemble ng mga circuit, maaari ka nang mag-sample ng mga bitstring mula sa mga ito. Para magawa iyon, kailangang i-execute ang mga circuit sa hardware. Tingnan ang [Qiskit documentation](/guides/intro-to-patterns) para sa detalyadong tagubilin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once the bitstring samples have been obtained, these can be used in combination with the Hamiltonian coefficients to perform SQD post-processing, as explained in the [SQD addon tutorials](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/overview).\n"
msgstr "Kapag nakuha na ang mga bitstring sample, maaari itong gamitin kasama ng mga coefficient ng Hamiltonian para magsagawa ng SQD post-processing, gaya ng ipinaliwanag sa [SQD addon tutorials](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/overview).\n"
